  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "The chef is in a terrible mood, and he is stomping round the kitchen picking at things. A dirty box is in the wrong place, and he still hasn't found his knife. Lyova, his sous-chef, has to answer for it. Here is the exchange in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
